UFUZY+ArialMT`, `Alpha0`) from an unrelated file.\n\n## (2) To unblock this, any one of:\n\n1. **Grant bash permission** (the cleanest fix — `Expand-Archive` + `pip install pypdf`, or `pdftotext`).\n2. **Pre-extract** `Job Listing.pdf` into the repo, e.g. `D:\\GoatCode-ts\\gaia\\data\\job-listing.pdf`, and tell me the path.\n3. **Attach a PNG/JPG render of the PDF pages** — the `read` tool does display images to me visually, so I could transcribe them verbatim.\n4. Enable `webfetch` and give me a public URL for the file."}
